==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Johnnyleon, Aku Gory and Ackey is a deceptively deadly combo. Johnnyleon can serve as a tank, making it hard for units to sneak into Ackey's blindspot, while Aku Gory can kill anything that does sneak in. There are two ways of dealing with this, either using Johnnyleon as a stepping stone to hit Ackey, or bursting down Johnnyleon with powerful attackers.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] - Uses wave attacks to damage Ackeys and Aku Gories from a distance using Johnnyleon as a stepping stone.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] - Similar to Pizza Cat in this level, but with higher damage in exchange for needing to be timed.
*Talented [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] - Has savage blows to eliminate Aku Gories quickly if you have stacked enough of them before hitting the base.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Courier is an extremely good generalist and has piercing range. Note that Courier cat can quickly eliminate Johnnyleon, which can either be good or bad depending on the strategy.
*[[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] - If opting to destroy Johnnyleon instead of using him as a stepping stone, Royal Guard is perfect for the job with his '''20k''' DPS against Aliens at just level 30.
*[[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] - Supercar is very versatile, as it can be used to instantly wipe out Ackey, knockback Johnnyleon further into Ackey's blindspot, or simply to get a free kill on an Aku Doge, helping to stall at the start.

==Trivia==
*Seahorses Caught's Japanese name, Ami ni Kakarishi Otoshigo ("Consequences Caught in a Net"), is a pun: ''otoshigo'' means "undesirable consequence/aftermath", but is also part of the term ''tatsu no otoshigo'', meaning "[[Ackey|seahorse]]".

